#-index-name: Spanish, mathematics, 8-dot
#-display-name: Spanish 8-dot mathematical braille
# Note: "8-dot" distinguishes this code (CBE B 14-1) from the 6-dot
# Código Matemático Unificado para Iberoamérica (CMU) also used in Spain.
